OL,3,GNEWSA'Like Hilary Swank, I had a baby
OL,4,Ain my fifties'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast week, US actor Hilary Swank
OL,7,Fannounced on Instagram that she was
OL,8,Fexpecting her third child in December -
OL,9,Fat the age of 52.
OL,11,FThe congratulations flooded in, but so
OL,12,Fdid the criticism, with some claiming
OL,13,Fshe was too old to be having a baby.
OL,15,FKelly Clarke, from Crawley, West
OL,16,FSussex, had her daughter at 50 through
OL,17,FIVF and said, like Swank, she also
OL,18,Ffaced backlash, even from her own
OL,19,Ffamily.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
