OL,3,GNEWSA'Like Hilary Swank, I had a baby
OL,4,Ain my fifties'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They thought I was mad. My family
OL,7,Fdisowned me - didn't want to know," she
OL,8,Ftold BBC Radio Sussex.
